<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Roboto:wght@300;400&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    html,
    body {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .header-message {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header-message h1 {
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .header-message h3 {
      font-weight: lighter;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .password {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 12px;
    }

    .redirect {
      color: #2863d7;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-gray-50 flex flex-col gap-4 py-2 font-['Roboto']">
  <div class="header-message">
    <h1>Olá!</h1>
    <h2>Entre no link abaixo para confirmar o seu novo email</h2>
    <h3>Se você não sabe o porquê de ter recebido este email, ou acredita ter sido engano, apenas ignore</h3>
    <a href="<%= link %>" class="redirect">Verificar Email</a>
  </div>
</body>

</html>